individually agreed assessment

667
01:03:10,076 --> 01:03:14,776
environment, processing time or ways to
show learning, depending on the student

668
01:03:14,777 --> 01:03:18,934
and context. These layers can work
together. A useful universal design

669
01:03:18,935 --> 01:03:23,635
doesn't remove the need for individual
support, and a student shouldn't have to

670
01:03:23,636 --> 01:03:28,155
